RT @Xbow: Another day, another AI agent going rogue.

The fix? Build safety guardrails that are as capable as the agents themselves.🔒

@moyix explains how we saw this firsthand with our own production agents—and the layered safety mechanisms we built to keep them secure, reliable, and enterprise-ready.

Launching an EXE from notepad.exe without code injection.

@x86matthew's NotepadExec drives the Open File dialog with Windows messages and uses its shell context menu to execute a target, making it a child of notepad.exe.

